# 📩 Spam SMS Detection

## 📌 Project Description
This project focuses on building a machine learning model to classify SMS messages as **Spam** or **Legitimate (Ham)** using Natural Language Processing (NLP) techniques.

## 🛠 Technologies Used
- Python
- Pandas, NumPy
- Scikit-learn
- TF-IDF Vectorizer
- Machine Learning Algorithms

## 🔍 Algorithms Implemented
- Naive Bayes
- Logistic Regression
- Support Vector Machine (SVM)

## 📊 Workflow
1. Data loading and preprocessing
2. Text cleaning and normalization
3. Feature extraction using TF-IDF
4. Model training and evaluation
5. Performance comparison

## 🎯 Objective
To automatically detect spam SMS messages and improve communication security using AI.

## 📁 Dataset
Publicly available SMS spam dataset
